KOF programming language
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
KofTerm is written in KOF and is built with the KOF compiler and runtime.

  Creator:     Mel Santos (Melissa Monfre dos Santos)
               https://github.com/melmonfre
               https://www.linkedin.com/in/aminadojava/
  Repository:  https://github.com/KofLang/Kof4j  (central KOF repository)
  Site:        https://koflang.github.io
  License:     GNU General Public License v3.0

The KOF logo referenced in README.md is loaded from the KofLang/Kof4j
repository and belongs to the KOF project.

